### 变量
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@accessToken = paste-login-or-switch-token-here
@spaceId = paste-space-id-from-get-org-spaces-here
@knowledgeId = paste-knowledge-id-here
@workflowId = paste-workflow-id-here
@nodeType = intentNode

### 创建并启动工作流
# knowledgeIds 必须是数组，且最多 3 个；这些知识库必须属于同一个 spaceId。
POST {{baseUrl}}/workflow/create
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "prompt": "做一张夏日海报，极简风格，突出品牌主色和清晰 Logo",
  "spaceId": "{{spaceId}}",
  "knowledgeIds": ["{{knowledgeId}}"]
}

### 创建并启动工作流（不使用知识库）
POST {{baseUrl}}/workflow/create
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "prompt": "做一张夏日海报，极简风格",
  "spaceId": "{{spaceId}}",
  "knowledgeIds": []
}

### 获取工作流详情
GET {{baseUrl}}/workflow/{{workflowId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 更新指定节点输出
PUT {{baseUrl}}/workflow/{{workflowId}}/nodes/{{nodeType}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "summary": "手动更新节点输出",
  "notes": ["REST Client 调试"]
}

### 从指定节点重新运行工作流
POST {{baseUrl}}/workflow/{{workflowId}}/nodes/{{nodeType}}/run
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 订阅工作流 SSE 事件流
GET {{baseUrl}}/workflow/{{workflowId}}/stream
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
